#. from ubuntu:dpkg-cross
msgid "\ndpkg-cross version %s\n\nUsage:\n dpkg-cross [OPTIONS] [--install|-i] <files...>\n dpkg-cross [OPTIONS] [--build|-b] <files...>\n dpkg-cross [OPTIONS] [--remove|--purge|-r] <packages...>\n dpkg-cross [OPTIONS] [--status|-s] <packages...>\n dpkg-cross [OPTIONS] [--list|-l] <packages...>\n dpkg-cross [OPTIONS] [--list-files|-L] <packages...>\n dpkg-cross [OPTIONS] [--query|-Q] <pkgpath>\n dpkg-cross [OPTIONS] [--update|-u] <pkgpath>\n\nCommands:\n -?|-h|--help|--version: print this message.\n\nOptions:\n -a|--arch ARCH:         set architecture (default: defined in configuration file)\n -v|--verbose:           be verbose\n -q|--quiet:             be quiet\n -A|--convert-anyway:    convert package even if it does not provide any\n                         development files\n -M|--convert-multiarch: convert package even if it is a multiarch package\n -X|--exclude PACKAGE:   Exclude this package from the dependency list of the\n                         built package.\n -k|--keep-temp:         Keep the temporary archives when installing.\n\ndpkg-cross installs or removes libraries and include files for\ncross-compiling Debian packages. It reads /etc/dpkg-cross/cross-compile\nto determine the base directory of the cross compiler installation, and\nworks in the subdirectories lib and include there.\n\n"
msgstr "\ndpkg-cross version %s\n\nAnvändning:\n dpkg-cross [FLAGGOR] [--install|-i] <filer...>\n dpkg-cross [FLAGGOR] [--build|-b] <filer...>\n dpkg-cross [FLAGGOR] [--remove|--purge|-r] <paket...>\n dpkg-cross [FLAGGOR] [--status|-s] <paket...>\n dpkg-cross [FLAGGOR] [--list|-l] <paket...>\n dpkg-cross [FLAGGOR] [--list-files|-L] <paket...>\n dpkg-cross [FLAGGOR] [--query|-Q] <paketsökväg>\n dpkg-cross [FLAGGOR] [--update|-u] <paketsökväg>\n\nKommandon:\n -?|-h|--help|--version: skriv ut detta meddelande.\n\nAlternativ:\n -a|--arch ARCH:         ställ in arkitektur (standard: definierad i konfigurationsfilen)\n -v|--verbose:           var utförlig\n -q|--quiet:             var tyst\n -A|--convert-anyway:    konvertera paket även om det inte tillhandahåller några\n                         utvecklingsfiler\n -M|--convert-multiarch: konvertera paket även om det är ett multiarch-paket\n -X|--exclude PAKET:     Uteslut detta paket från beroendelistan för det\n                         byggda paketet.\n -k|--keep-temp:         Behåll de tillfälliga arkiven vid installation.\n\ndpkg-cross installerar eller tar bort bibliotek och inkluderar filer för\nkorskompilering av Debian-paket. Det läser /etc/dpkg-cross/cross-compile\nför att bestämma baskatalogen för korskompilatorns installation och\nfungerar i underkatalogerna lib och include där.\n\n"

